# TokyoNight Night — color tokens
# Sourced in place (not stowed) as $DOTFILES_DIR/theme/colors.
# Hand-authored configs (Waybar, Fuzzel, Mako, hyprlock, Hyprland) copy these
# hex values directly since none of those tools can `source` a shell file for
# styling — keep this file as the single point of truth when the values
# themselves ever change, and grep for the old hex to find every copy.

